    "title": "Fighterfighter from Clinton County dives into action while on vacation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "6 hours ago LOCK HAVEN, Pa. — 'We Fight For Life' is written on an apparatus belonging to Citizens Hose Company Number 5 in Lock Haven. Those words came to life while 20-year-old Brock Brungard was on vacation with his girlfriend's family at Assateague Island near Ocean City, Maryland. Brungard says a regular beach day turned into a rescue mission when strong rip currents pulled multiple people underwater. That's when he jumped into the ocean to help. Read full article\n4",
